// The 3rd Age axe's OWN animation, converted out of the 474 cache (seq 7264, which RuneLite names
// HUMAN_WOODCUTTING_3A_AXE). Its frames sit in group 209 rather than the 207 the other woodcutting
// seqs use, but the rig is what matters and it is skeleton 0 - the 227-transform-group player rig
// that every other chop animates. The gilded axe has no period animation of its own (OSRS gave it
// one at seq 8303, long after this cache), so it keeps the rune axe's, which is what its config
// already named.
[woodcutting_third_age_axe]
param=skill_anim,seq_474_7264
